   "id": "root",
   "x": 345,
   "y": 10,
   "w": 760,
   "kind": "dark",
   "title": "Antivirals: WHICH VIRUS picks the drug",
   "lines": [
    "herpesviruses: block viral DNA polymerase · influenza: mostly block neuraminidase, so new virus cannot leave the cell",
    "almost all are cleared by the kidney: ADJUST the dose in renal dysfunction"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g_hv",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 138,
   "w": 660,
   "h": 60,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "HERPESVIRUS: which one?",
   "lines": [
